#adm/daemons/mailmesg.c
remain ({"yueh","vincent",})
mesg "hi! vincent  从22日中午起ES每天至少crash两次，因此我看log找出21日到22日有修改过的档案。你有改了  /d/monk/gonfus/general/body-def.c, /d/monk/gonfus/general/dragon-claw.c /d/monk/gonfus/general/keep-flower.c, /d/monk/gonfus/general/power-finger.c /d/monk/gonfus/general/bolo-fist.c这些档案。请你再检查一次这些档案有无写错的地方，并请向我回报，我要查出原因为何，并 防 止 ES继续crash。谢谢！  Sinerely Yours, Yueh"
